# Block strings: markdown, code and latex labels, plus the text shape.
doc: |md
  # Heading
  Some **bold** text and a list:
  - one
  - two
|
snippet: |go
  func main() {
      fmt.Println("hi")
  }
|
formula: |latex
  \sum_{i=0}^{n} i^2
|
plain: { shape: text; label: just text }
doc -> snippet -> formula
